<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), follow the screen display to display the [ECU Data Monitor] screen and check the ECU data.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>[Diagnosis menu screen: Powertrain → ECT → ECU Data Monitor]</title>
<tgroup cols="4" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.77in"/>
